### API restaurants & menus
### Arranca: pnpm dev   (o npm run dev)
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Listar restaurants
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants

### Un restaurant (cambia el id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants/ID_AQUI

### Menus de un restaurant
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants/ID_AQUI/menus

### Listar menus
GET {{baseUrl}}/menus

### Un menu
GET {{baseUrl}}/menus/ID_AQUI

### Crear restaurant
POST {{baseUrl}}/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nuevo Rest",
  "city": "Sevilla",
  "cuisine": "Andaluza",
  "rating": 4.0
}

### Crear menu (usa un restaurantId real)
POST {{baseUrl}}/menus
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": "ID_AQUI",
  "name": "Menu degustacion",
  "price": 35,
  "dishes": ["Entrante", "Principal", "Postre"]
}
